Firefox on Haiku: link libxul with libgcc_s

The Rust standard library in gkrust needs the _Unwind_* functions. haiku-pi's rebuilt gcc_syslibs
has libstdc++ depend on libgcc_s; the bootstrap package the C2 image has does not (libstdc++ needs
only libroot, tools/haiku-arm64-env.sh: HAIKU_CXX_LIBS). MPL 2.0, like the file it changes.

diff -ruN a/toolkit/library/moz.build b/toolkit/library/moz.build
--- a/toolkit/library/moz.build	2026-11-03 08:55:42.857406078 -0500
+++ b/toolkit/library/moz.build	2026-11-03 08:55:42.869059755 -0500
@@ -113,6 +113,9 @@
         "be",
         "game",
         "GL",
+        # the Rust standard library in gkrust unwinds with _Unwind_*; the C2
+        # image's libstdc++ doesn't bring libgcc_s along
+        "gcc_s",
     ]
 
 # The real libxul definition is in ./build/moz.build, but we define a
